<title>INDIA: India's HDFC Bank 96/971st half net up.</title>
<headline>India's HDFC Bank 96/971st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>6 months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	    (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  191.44   vs    113.97</p>
<p>    Interest income   738.48   vs    581.34</p>
<p>    Total income	906.40   vs    609.31</p>
<p>    Interest expense  420.65   vs    327.52</p>
<p>    Expenditure	 613.98   vs    458.55</p>
<p>    Gross profit	292.42   vs    150.76</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 39.30   vs	7.44</p>
<p>    Taxation	     61.68   vs     29.34</p>
<p>Note: HDFC Bank is a subsidiary of Housing Development Finance Corp. Total income includes income from non-fund based activties, the bank said. The results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
